# Phase 15 — Global Queue + Scheduler 1:1 Parity Plan

## Overview
Phase 15 migrates Laravel's global background-processing and scheduling infrastructure to Java 21 + Spring Boot while maintaining 1:1 parity with all previously migrated business modules (Phases 1–14).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Strict Migration Boundaries & Zero Code Changes Phase Rules:**
> 1. **Database Parity:** Uses existing MySQL schema (`jobs`, `failed_jobs`, `job_batches`). No database migrations or schema alterations allowed.
> 2. **Phase 16 Deferred:** Realtime broadcasting infrastructure (Pusher / Laravel Echo / Reverb) is strictly deferred to Phase 16.
> 3. **Queue Compatibility:** Native Java JSON payload serializer is used for new dispatches. Old PHP serialized payloads (if any) are drained prior to Java queue takeover.

---

## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> None. All 22 background jobs, 13 queued notifications, and 12 scheduled tasks have been inventoried and mapped to Java Spring components.

