## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Core Queue & Storage Infrastructure
- **Models:** [`Job.java`](file:///d:/hubnotification/java-backend/src/main/java/com/whatsmine/model/Job.java), [`FailedJob.java`](file:///d:/hubnotification/java-backend/src/main/java/com/whatsmine/model/FailedJob.java)
- **Repositories:** [`JobRepository.java`](file:///d:/hubnotification/java-backend/src/main/java/com/whatsmine/repository/JobRepository.java), [`FailedJobRepository.java`](file:///d:/hubnotification/java-backend/src/main/java/com/whatsmine/repository/FailedJobRepository.java)
- **Services:**
  - `QueueDispatcher` (dispatches jobs to MySQL `jobs` table with JSON payload, delay calculation, and queue routing)
  - `QueueWorker` (background worker loop picking available jobs, locking via database transaction, executing handler, handling retries/backoff, logging failed jobs, and deleting completed jobs)

